OL,3,GNEWSAHackney drops opposition to waste
OL,4,Aincinerator
OL,5,
OL,6,FHackney Council has dropped its
OL,7,Fopposition to a #1.5bn waste
OL,8,Fincinerator project, which is now
OL,9,Fforecast to cost the authority millions
OL,10,Fof pounds more than expected earlier
OL,11,Fthis year.
OL,13,FAhead of the 2026 local elections, the
OL,14,FHackney Green Party pledged in its
OL,15,Fmanifesto to "explore every option to
OL,16,Fcancel" the reconstruction of an ageing
OL,17,Frubbish incinerator serving seven north
OL,18,FLondon councils.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
