OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1793521534
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHackney drops opposition to waste
OL,4,Aincinerator
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after winning control of the
OL,7,Fcouncil in May, the party says
OL,8,Fabandoning the project would be
OL,9,Ffinancially and environmentally
OL,10,F"devastating".
OL,12,FWork to rebuild the ageing Edmonton
OL,13,Fplant began in 2022, but the scheme has
OL,14,Ffaced opposition for decades over
OL,15,Fconcerns about air pollution and carbon
OL,16,Femissions.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
